# Format:
#   <git-repo-url> [branch_or_commit]
#
# Instructions:
#   - Uncomment (#) any module you want to download and compile.
#   - Leave commented (#) modules you do NOT want.
#   - By default, the latest commit of the default branch (master/main) is pulled.
#   - Optionally specify a branch, tag, or commit hash after the URL if desired:
#       https://github.com/user/repo.git custom-branch
# ==============================================================================

